WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.934
-Welcome back to the show. Welcome back.

00:00:02.934 --> 00:00:04.834
It's always great to see you. -It feels like home.

00:00:04.834 --> 00:00:07.234
-It should feel like home. -It's so cozy on this couch.

00:00:07.234 --> 00:00:09.367
-We love having you here. -Thanks for having me.

00:00:09.367 --> 00:00:10.934
-We have things to talk about, by the way.

00:00:10.934 --> 00:00:13.701
Congratulations. You got married?

00:00:13.701 --> 00:00:15.300
-Yes! -Hey, come on, now!

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.300
[ Cheers and applause ] Rita!

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.701
-I know, and because I love you so much,

00:00:19.701 --> 00:00:21.701
I actually have never shown anyone my ring.

00:00:21.701 --> 00:00:23.667
-[ Gasps ] -It's my first time

00:00:23.667 --> 00:00:25.567
showing my ring, because I love you

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:27.767
and I feel like you're part of our relationship, weirdly,

00:00:27.767 --> 00:00:29.100
because we watch you every night.

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:30.200
-Yeah. -Is that creepy?

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:31.501
-No, it's not. [ Laughter ]

00:00:31.501 --> 00:00:33.400
I feel like I'm part of the relationship, as well.

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.300
-I just felt like I'll show you it.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.868
Look. Here it is. And I'll show you guys, too.

00:00:37.868 --> 00:00:39.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:40.801
Look.

00:00:40.801 --> 00:00:42.634
-Ooh la-la! That's gorgeous.

00:00:42.634 --> 00:00:44.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:44.434 --> 00:00:47.167
-Now, your husband -- -He did good.

00:00:47.167 --> 00:00:48.567
-Taika Waititi.

00:00:48.567 --> 00:00:50.667
-Yes, you said it right! Wow!

00:00:50.667 --> 00:00:52.033
-What? Have I said Taika wrong?

00:00:52.033 --> 00:00:53.434
-No, no, never.

00:00:53.434 --> 00:00:55.868
But sometimes it's hard for some people to say his name.

00:00:55.868 --> 00:00:57.067
-I love that.

00:00:57.067 --> 00:01:00.067
Did he choose that or did you help with that?

00:01:00.067 --> 00:01:02.100
-[ Clears throat ] Well, I may have.

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:04.267
-Helped. Maybe hinted.

00:01:04.267 --> 00:01:05.367
-In the right -- -Guided him.

00:01:05.367 --> 00:01:07.133
-You know, 'cause I just think, like,

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:10.234
when you know what you want -- and I felt like I really knew

00:01:10.234 --> 00:01:12.801
that I wanted to be with this person.

00:01:12.801 --> 00:01:14.901
I just wanted it to feel really right,

00:01:14.901 --> 00:01:16.801
and so I may have taken him to the shop

00:01:16.801 --> 00:01:20.834
and I may have pointed out exactly what ring I wanted.

00:01:20.834 --> 00:01:24.033
-You are the most fun person.

00:01:24.033 --> 00:01:27.634
Every time I see you guys on a red carpet or something --

00:01:27.634 --> 00:01:28.868
-Oh, you mean that time

00:01:28.868 --> 00:01:31.701
where you crashed our red-carpet photograph?

00:01:31.701 --> 00:01:33.100
Show them.

00:01:33.100 --> 00:01:36.067
-I would never do such a thing as long as I live.

00:01:36.067 --> 00:01:37.701
-Can we just talk about this? Because it was the best --

00:01:37.701 --> 00:01:40.901
We actually love this photo. Look. Show them. Look at that!

00:01:40.901 --> 00:01:42.400
-Yeah. -Look.

00:01:42.400 --> 00:01:46.601
-Yeah. You were taking photos...

00:01:46.601 --> 00:01:49.567
You were taking photos and looking, like, all glamorous

00:01:49.567 --> 00:01:51.534
And then I just jumped in like, "Hey, guys!"

00:01:51.534 --> 00:01:53.133
-Do you know why I love this photo?

00:01:53.133 --> 00:01:56.167
Because I look like I crashed the photograph.

00:01:56.167 --> 00:01:57.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.701 --> 00:02:03.033
You two look like you have been together your whole lives.

00:02:03.033 --> 00:02:05.534
-Yeah. I have news for you.

00:02:05.534 --> 00:02:08.767
I'm married to Taika Waititi. I'm gonna show you my ring.

00:02:08.767 --> 00:02:10.801
-But I love that photo. We love you so much.

00:02:10.801 --> 00:02:12.367
-Oh, come on, bud. -So, yeah.

00:02:12.367 --> 00:02:15.367
-Congrats on everything. Let's talk about the single.

00:02:15.367 --> 00:02:17.434
"You Only Love Me." Which is out now.

00:02:17.434 --> 00:02:18.734
-Yes, yes.

00:02:18.734 --> 00:02:21.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:21.234 --> 00:02:23.300
Yeah. -Hinting at an upcoming album.

00:02:23.300 --> 00:02:26.000
-Yes, my album comes out later on this year.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:28.968
Oh, you know, I'm just so excited about this music.

00:02:28.968 --> 00:02:30.934
-You are? -Not just because it's mine.

00:02:30.934 --> 00:02:33.133
But because my journ-- [ Laughter ]

00:02:33.133 --> 00:02:34.767
I know. Weird. Again, I'm weird.

00:02:34.767 --> 00:02:37.501
But because I feel like the journey

00:02:37.501 --> 00:02:39.968
it took me to get to this point and the past two years --

00:02:39.968 --> 00:02:42.033
Like, my life has changed so drastically.

00:02:42.033 --> 00:02:44.634
And making a decision to really spend

00:02:44.634 --> 00:02:46.501
the rest of your life with someone

00:02:46.501 --> 00:02:48.801
is a kind of big decision, you know?

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:51.534
And so, like, it got me writing again,

00:02:51.534 --> 00:02:53.734
and I just really got inspired by love.

00:02:53.734 --> 00:02:55.634
And even though it sounds cheesy,

00:02:55.634 --> 00:02:58.000
all those sort of phases of meting somebody,

00:02:58.000 --> 00:02:59.534
and then do you really like them?

00:02:59.534 --> 00:03:01.000
Do they like me?

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:03.067
Do I say that we're together?

00:03:03.067 --> 00:03:05.968
Can we be exclusive? Like, what is going on?

00:03:05.968 --> 00:03:07.234
You know that little bit in the beginning?

00:03:07.234 --> 00:03:09.167
-I don't miss any of that stuff.

00:03:09.167 --> 00:03:12.000
-Yeah, and that's what I wrote all my feelings about.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:13.968
And it's nice to capture the moment.

00:03:13.968 --> 00:03:15.567
So I feel like this is more than just music.

00:03:15.567 --> 00:03:18.133
It's like a moment in life for me, so...

00:03:18.133 --> 00:03:20.501
-I'm so happy for you.

00:03:20.501 --> 00:03:21.801
[ Cheers and applause ] -Yeah.

00:03:21.801 --> 00:03:25.400
-The wedding-themed video for the single

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:27.267
"You Only Love Me" just came out.

00:03:27.267 --> 00:03:29.133
It is so fun, by the way. Go check it out.

00:03:29.133 --> 00:03:31.734
Go on YouTube. Look this up. -We got a few fun cameos.

00:03:31.734 --> 00:03:34.734
Sorry. I would have asked you, but it was all the ladies.

00:03:34.734 --> 00:03:36.267
I wanted the ladies in this video.

00:03:36.267 --> 00:03:37.801
-Who do you have? I saw --

00:03:37.801 --> 00:03:40.267
I saw Kristen Stewart.

00:03:40.267 --> 00:03:41.834
-Kristen Stewart's in it.

00:03:41.834 --> 00:03:44.834
Sharon Stone plays my sort of savior godmother.

00:03:44.834 --> 00:03:47.567
She brings my -- She is the best.

00:03:47.567 --> 00:03:49.367
So fun. Who else?

00:03:49.367 --> 00:03:51.834
-Lindsay Lohan. -Lindsay. Iconic!

00:03:51.834 --> 00:03:53.300
-Yeah, it's the best. It's great.

00:03:53.300 --> 00:03:55.334
Just check it out. You have to see it. It's good.

00:03:55.334 --> 00:03:58.367
It's a wedding -- It's a crazy --

00:03:58.367 --> 00:04:00.534
-I'm so in love -- I'm like a film buff, you know?

00:04:00.534 --> 00:04:02.634
So it was like --

00:04:02.634 --> 00:04:04.534
I love films and I wanted to play a character.

00:04:04.534 --> 00:04:06.400
Like, I love "Bridezilla" and I love "Heathers"

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:08.667
and I love, like, "Edward Scissorhands."

00:04:08.667 --> 00:04:10.534
So I just wanted to have fun with the video.

00:04:10.534 --> 00:04:11.901
-Yeah, it's fantastic.

00:04:11.901 --> 00:04:13.334
And you're gonna perform that song for us later.

00:04:13.334 --> 00:04:15.334
-I am! -Which I appreciate. Thank you.

00:04:15.334 --> 00:04:16.834
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:16.834 --> 00:04:20.534
I want to quickly mention that you're back for season two

00:04:20.534 --> 00:04:22.400
of "Kung Fu Panda: The Dragon Knight,"

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:24.167
which is streaming now on Netflix.

00:04:24.167 --> 00:04:26.067
With my man Jack Black. -We love Jack.

00:04:26.067 --> 00:04:28.434
-No. Come on! How great is Jack Black?

00:04:28.434 --> 00:04:29.667
I love Jack Black!

00:04:29.667 --> 00:04:31.133
-Like, he's just -- [ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:31.133 --> 00:04:32.868
Yes, he deserves a round of applause, for sure.

00:04:32.868 --> 00:04:35.801
He is the most incredible person, because for me,

00:04:35.801 --> 00:04:37.601
going out there and sort of like --

00:04:37.601 --> 00:04:39.667
You don't even have to get dressed.

00:04:39.667 --> 00:04:40.934
You're doing a voiceover.

00:04:40.934 --> 00:04:42.934
You can go in your pajamas. It's, like, so cool.

00:04:42.934 --> 00:04:45.367
He's like, "Hey, man, just be yourself."

00:04:45.367 --> 00:04:47.467
I'm like, "Yeah, Panda is you, Jack.

00:04:47.467 --> 00:04:49.234
You are Panda."

00:04:49.234 --> 00:04:52.834
You know? And so I try to be me with Bear.

00:04:52.834 --> 00:04:55.534
So, Blade, my character --

00:04:55.534 --> 00:04:57.300
It was just the best time working with him.

00:04:57.300 --> 00:04:58.767
-I want to show everyone a clip.

00:04:58.767 --> 00:05:00.334
Here's Rita Ora and Jack Black

00:05:00.334 --> 00:05:01.868
in "Kung Fu Panda: The Dragon Knight."

00:05:01.868 --> 00:05:03.467
Take a look at this.

00:05:03.467 --> 00:05:04.834
-What a nail biter!

00:05:04.834 --> 00:05:07.100
Team Dragon, 49. The Blood Boys, 49.

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:08.901
-[ Gasps and growls ]

00:05:08.901 --> 00:05:10.100
What are you playing at?

00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:12.501
We're only one goal away from winning!

00:05:12.501 --> 00:05:14.601
-Blade, this has to stop.

00:05:14.601 --> 00:05:17.367
-I will not lose. I will not be a loser.

00:05:17.367 --> 00:05:19.367
The Beast wins!

00:05:19.367 --> 00:05:20.834
-What if I told you those armadillos

00:05:20.834 --> 00:05:22.734
need to talk to Zuma more than we do?

00:05:22.734 --> 00:05:24.667
-This is how you want to get the Storm Wheels,

00:05:24.667 --> 00:05:26.567
so this is how we're getting the Storm Wheels.

00:05:26.567 --> 00:05:28.501
-And we can find another way

00:05:28.501 --> 00:05:30.334
because we're Po and Blade.

00:05:30.334 --> 00:05:32.901
Po-lade. Played.

00:05:32.901 --> 00:05:34.267
No Beast necessary.

00:05:34.267 --> 00:05:36.400
-There's no turning back now!

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:39.567
-That's exactly right. You tell him. Rita Ora!

00:05:39.567 --> 00:05:42.434
Season two of "Kung Fu Panda: The Dragon Knight"

00:05:42.434 --> 00:05:43.868
is streaming now on Netflix.

00:05:43.868 --> 00:05:46.200
And Rita is performing her new single,

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:49.000
"You Only Love Me," when we come back.

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:50.968
Stick around, everybody!

